# Lane maps as xor exchange stages (lperm.c): an affine map is decomposed
# into rank(I xor A) conditional exchanges, priced, and the stages are
# composed on every lane to prove the map.  With no xor/quad class the
# model falls back to one shuffle by the index.
lperm lane xor (lane & 1) << 1
lperm lane xor (lane & 1) << 1 model rdna2
lperm lane & 28 model rdna2
lperm (lane | 1) xor ((lane & 4) >> 1) model rdna2
lperm (lane & 3) * 8 + (lane >> 2) model rdna2
lperm (lane xor 1) lanes 64 model rdna2
